id: pm-web-qdhx
title: Investigate full-coverage process startup and overlap timing failures
description: "During PR #175 round-1 validation, the unchanged missing-database server entrypoint test exceeded its 10000 ms execFileSync deadline under full npm coverage; focused execution passes 1/1 at 9065 ms. The corrected full Bun coverage run also failed the unchanged independent-workspace spawn overlap test, which passed in the npm run. Capture exact failure details, distinguish resource contention or fixture scheduling assumptions from runtime regressions, and preserve every existing assertion/deadline while investigating. The correction patch changes package command UI, one extension-route selector guard and catalog SSE test cleanup; it changes neither startup nor runner implementation. Graph latency is tracked separately by pm-web-hqqp."
