  "2026-10-15T12:01:29.778Z",codex-agent,"Contrasting full Bun gate is green 593/593, zero fail/cancel/skip/todo. Unchanged Presets acceptance completed built at 237.128 seconds and source at 213.116 seconds against the same 300-second deadline; no code or assertion was changed between failed npm and passing Bun. Keep the original failures and timing follow-up open. A further isolated npm run will test reproducibility without overlapping this task's other gates."
  "2026-10-15T12:14:15.642Z",codex-agent,"Final isolated npm release gate on unchanged graph security code passes 593/593 with zero fail/cancel/skip/todo. Unchanged catalog cases complete built at 120.117 seconds and source at 99.979 seconds, after the two previously recorded failed npm runs. Full Bun gate also passes 593/593. Both full green gates include packed consumers 4/4 and zero production audit vulnerabilities. This supplies contrasting acceptance evidence; the aggregate deadline/cancellation sensitivity is not repaired by the graph change and remains open."
